# Git authorship

Only `abhishektakale <abhishektakale@users.noreply.github.com>` may appear as author or committer.

- Pass `--author="abhishektakale <abhishektakale@users.noreply.github.com>"` on every `git commit`.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with: Cursor`, Cursor, cursoragent, or any other person or bot to commit messages or PRs.
- Do not use `git commit --trailer`.
- Do not run `git config` to change user.name or user.email.
- After committing, if a trailer was injected, amend (if not yet pushed) and strip it before pushing.
